<title>UK: Credit Local sets 2.0 bln FFR 12-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:22 GMT]</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 2.0 bln FFR 12-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:22 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    26.FEB.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.717   PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    100.767   SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p>(Lead manager corrects reoffer price from 100.765)</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     GOV LAW     FRENCH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10/45 BP  SELL CONC  75 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
